  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extended support to UNSCO 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project (impact) is to contribute to preventing conflict and reversing the current downward human development trajectory of Gaza and the occupied Palestinian Territory (oPT) more broadly. 

The overall objective is to be reached through a set of specific objectives (outcomes):

1. Enhanced implementation of UNSCO&#x2019;s political mandate and support to the Ad Hoc Liaison Committee (AHLC).
2. A strengthened Palestinian Authority by promoting an enabling environment for Palestinian socio-economic development. 
3. Eased access and trade in and out of and between Gaza and the West Bank</narrative>
  </description>
